# API project (repository root). Only pyproject.toml, index.py, vercel.json, src/ and
# agents/prompts/ (read by bolna/agent_config.py when provisioning compiles an agent) are
# needed at runtime. web/ is not listed: Vercel applies this repository-root file to the
# web project too (root directory web/), so the API keeps web/ out of its function through
# excludeFiles in vercel.json instead.
dashboard/
tests/
docs/
agents/*
!agents/prompts/
migrations/
.github/
.claude/
.venv/
.env
.env.*
compose.yaml
Dockerfile
*.md
!agents/prompts/*.md
